Package: sampleSizeCalc
Title: Sample Size Calculator for Clinical Research
Version: 2.1.0
Author: AI Coding Assistant [aut, cre]
Maintainer: AI Coding Assistant <ai@example.com>
Authors@R: person("AI Coding Assistant", email = "ai@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive tool for calculating sample sizes across 
    various clinical study designs. Supports continuous variables, proportions, 
    survival analysis, diagnostic tests, case-control studies, and more. 
    Built following Tidy R design principles with comprehensive parameter 
    validation, structured error handling, and complete literature citations
    including primary methodology papers.
